{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1550,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3a889847548458ca2468288",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "奇锐骏！\\n用坚忍不拔的跑法向粉丝们传递了希望\\n展现了属于熏银的潜力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6224242da527d1a9858badb5dc698099ed22a63730486468a0357ce7c62a741",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:116408afab18ef0659043116",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "微光飞驹，\\n用她配得上英雄之名的跑法\\n给我们带来了梦想和希望！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37199bb1b0d55de0cd034ea100b5f97846f2ea16f7d4163e9fbc59b5a97ca96e",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3112"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6fa0e92cb6e8b790a8618db",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "大鸣大放！！\\n完美展现了自己的血脉之结晶\\n成为了最强者的化身！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b723c6c49605933273b1897f2862b7361cad11643a44dc2f711bfe891e8a9ce",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68dd116313f9d7c2010faf01",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "创升！\\n她寻求开拓新领域不断奔跑着\\n成功超越了阻挡她的强敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b888740da72eb999ae737f5707a0856e024f323eb23168d0ec78b34c372d2549",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3114"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d871a0df2feb373ff299b24",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量！\\n向着自己的目标不断前进并获得胜利\\n将自己的跑法与心意传递给了后来者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "be551b16a2ab8fd4abe2305c884ad9e956c86435d8050e406015f7ac05c7d110",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3115"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc30c5b9f9ed181c9225e2d5",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "万籁争鸣！\\n她与对手们精彩合奏\\n向我们展示身为比赛的主角的跑法！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d210a54303aa723b8f35e38d776ceefafd4ab03ee1168065e71d58555baa0d4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3116"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63100ece6e82f1f1ad99815f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "北方飞翔！\\n凭借自己不懈努力所磨练出的美学\\n向我们展现出了最耀眼的光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b403f7c245b765649676a52c076e984a124b62a8b1c93f3ee54f4ed05784c90",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3117"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4bdf526d8e26427e8081ce8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "森林宝穴！\\n通过与强敌的对战所磨炼出的双脚\\n向我们证明了她就是最强者！",
      "source_fingerprint": "755d7befccaec15de524b305776ba2170bfc93493d1b1a96ead8e7edb78185a3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3118"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:120e7d917419a66e484d903c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "梦之旅！\\n以其天生聪慧和有素身体\\n获得了使自己旅途生辉的桂冠！",
      "source_fingerprint": "872db9908b52880ab05e000bda4f5e4a969ce2e794bde1285eb68ba223801c9d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3119"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f9a58461c1255032d8919e8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "贵妇人！\\n她在最重要一场比赛上展现出无人能敌的力量与高贵气质\\n证明了自己作为最强女帝的压倒性实力！",
      "source_fingerprint": "48c0c584c6b2b3d87a75304d92adaf9f10b0520a863ea6f7b5ffdcef25359611",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3120"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a8c8ffea3b23b00318fe53d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "鹤丸刚志！\\n无论跌倒多少次都始终向着憧憬伸出手，\\n绽放出了不逊于对手的最强光芒！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d07998009a364986a33d70b66f97b76803ea92d1facdce9c8b4f787b9ec03ec",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f41a66ae4f78d84931760e7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "目白高峰！\\n以那份憧憬与嫉妒都无法企及的魅惑跑法，\\n为我们展现了一场完美的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3e16ec6f2b6763620eef2c169da678050d1f55e17c54678ada12367c6f8ff60",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3122"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2a94dac563d118e8d30fd97",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "里见皇冠！\\n如同变魔术般决定了华丽的战术，\\n在这场大赛中将桂冠收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17a992517f99fa8ac01bd77754fc9f374ac8b6ab3668af934ff2ed142549e873",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3123"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e98b7f5cb5d9459f7ffb20f8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "高尚骏逸！\\n精彩地发挥了不逊于姐妹的才能，\\n展现出了无愧于「伟大赛马娘」之名的奔跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb0001aac75884c62473f1f954108964aad3507177e6de0a36e065cf7337bb24",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3124"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f676c6bebf35d5d00b63bf7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "强击！\\n那如同夜空中闪耀群星般的奔跑，\\n让凯歌响彻了遥远的中东大地！",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a5f2265a37f6eb4d7a1fece5fc65c95780e3cc34fc907dbed9039bf9285025",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3125"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d69140995704f60c1bd5dce6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "凯斯奇迹！\\n展现出了足以报答大恩的灵魂之跑，\\n用自己的双脚亲手创造了『奇迹』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c67c445a20e94823c37b5d45fe0acb43787dca993a0bbfdbd7addcb4f4f2e441",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3126"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce66750a4cb067231c46e95d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "跳舞城！\\n凭借高举的梦想与浪漫席卷赛马界，\\n将那独一无二的宝藏收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9ecd7b9fc4f6ce26de27428a4e46606bbd9c207e9653aa07382eea391970bf5",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3127"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4161b880dc58c90ce9648966",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥！\\n为了成为通往未来的基石而夺得荣冠，那身姿\\n正是日本的超级巨星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8f62027dc84c57b05aab2b7d51f5a024181d7a59094b6e84d57f9ca01904822",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3128"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dec24395789ce59d89177ca",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "空中救世主！\\n胸怀对母亲的爱意，让诚实的努力结出果实，\\n夺取了连接未来的辉煌荣耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5291d4f30d4fbf3d338d1f783294094a5c9f7318319f1d065c105e976b075ba1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3129"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eeccee964307d577dc4aad1",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金巨匠！\\n以压倒性的奔跑将所有荣耀尽收囊中，\\n向我们展示了那草地之王的身姿！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d9825f6e2d404a689a0da223152e8a099cd56e02d58e596cfaa68a690d9a205",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3130"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a22dbcffc3436a48848c1fb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "凯旋芭蕾！\\n面对强敌毫不退缩地数次站起，\\n精彩地夺得了领衔主演的宝座！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e26f8d92c5d3a3c6602dda9eb37302219891dcaa2cae387ab02897d5554d303",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3131"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:049efd8b3c50d5ede120a771",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "金镇之光！\\n抵达了连光芒都能甩在脑后的速度境界，\\n以最快之姿纵横赛马界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54760c43cd7f008ba4ae4a46c730f46fcc6035692ccfcb67039ad993172c9c0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3132"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be02953f596062faed2e0442",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "多旺达！\\n将身为忠诚骑士的骄傲寄托于那柄“圣剑”，\\n凭那举世无双的末脚斩落强敌！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9cd66636e0197839662d0f3d5b63bef8104606b62a15f2421a7cf7a0a78021c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3133"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e6c218543a25e9a05775331",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "吹波糖！\\n率先起跑冲在最前，用那双腿\\n达成了从未有人见过的伟业！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2cd90268734a6b87ce5d02b20650ccfa61c11e3d715bc0f5ed059d87bd676dd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3134"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ade29e00395ebfa5e1596b7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "极峰！\\n磨砺出不惧困难的不屈精神与高洁意志，\\n成为了屡战屡胜的最强女王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "946b8883edef8b3f1b5c00c0b8e9775db9d43e91f6d9984da766b1626c7484c1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3135"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee577c47b4a1f15e94b6cda",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "唯独爱你！\\n将满身承载的爱化作力量，用那跑姿\\n赢得了令全世界为之沉醉的胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa7c0213958e54bb1ed15989f12125b0a0366f9c7f5f9dd362815f5264b2738f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3136"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a308262bf22a11482ac47f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "创世驹！\\n凭借回应粉丝梦想的最强奔跑，\\n成为了被未来永世传颂的时代主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "247bcd994f496d9415ad8cbb9135e574ad4a3f98e41d9f5206692ac079a47908",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:725320ce26c1790a09cb9efd",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "爱如往昔！\\n证明了世上绝无仅有的皇冠之辉，\\n以魅惑的跑法，将荣光收入囊中！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3738febd51e29ed4c2f4617a6e3840f6a785c995b68e6126e73e82c5b8f1702d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3138"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ee4bd5b7d68910ce9053e7b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "放声欢呼！\\n让天真烂漫的才能尽情爆发，\\n以前所未有的次元末脚实现了超越！",
      "source_fingerprint": "10b00db267103ca67979e7f374be30fd5282b3ab226c772c03652275a7803c72",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3139"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:084ac13e00659ac8314db830",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "超常骏骥！\\n贯彻始终如一的踏实与诚实跑法，\\n凭堂堂正正的胜利登上了顶峰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "12a4f666382f05d442078e02b1c89327598289b9a4b55dd0259fe87d20192d02",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3140"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27b138885e3a47d05fa6410",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "莫名其妙！\\n精彩地讨伐了名声显赫的俊杰们，\\n达成了赛马界的天下统一！",
      "source_fingerprint": "47400ece990a3e7edf0bd59dc343c8a281bd353c5e449af2216ef93733024027",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3141"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81bd60b66d90017728d1825b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "烈焰快驹！\\n即便面对最强对手也坚持不懈地努力，\\n终于夺得了站在舞台中心的荣耀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "22c9f77cd15f8d37bb688b03bb7ef9bfb9388625a83e9efa4ea4c936427ca4f1",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3142"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdae97270817aa8c23a535c7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "迷人景致！\\n凭借那份备受喜爱的赤诚积累努力，\\n终于抵达了梦寐以求的“绝景”！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f0959568918abeddfdf0e61e7d16304c38024afe5199cde784dcc11a3a9e4fd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3143"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd1e2a965330790d7be92954",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "黄金旅程！\\n在备受粉丝关爱抵达的旅途终点，\\n夺得了夙愿已偿、且永恒不灭的荣光！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e9a2f8b4285bf33264d27dcb7872c56964b6d13f0481981eeb1b1420959992d9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:392521b83028d8d53a17e304",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "神业！\\n留下了不逊于最强女主角们的结果与记忆，\\n以此证明了自己才是比赛的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebba89b131c1e49c23d59f7b6318661e629ea8d3bd26422b95fb412570365cc9",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a29ce38e97a8f17fcb740c0b",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "莱斯莱斯！\\n在不懈钻研后抵达了戏剧性的结局，\\n让自己成为了赛马这场大戏的主角！",
      "source_fingerprint": "087aebfb7ab755e1452bb673c8dc0f64a0d6c946d5fbc3ed5bb64970dea4c428",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3146"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e65d002c6449d157ef6a55e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "杏目！\\n不断积累无人可及的长久荣光，\\n成为了名留青史的赛马界超级巨星！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1eb36e21991ea8f03614401e07bd509e86a73184aa8c4faef3c181091b34c83",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "3147"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75778caef45330f921d6d0d2",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "在这种紧绷的马场里\n更容易提升速度哦",
      "source_fingerprint": "cffab06320e552ddfdc62ff3662a7e9b0ceff974c05a82a9af5dc07894083cbb",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec03cf7ab674b40b87af7200",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "看起来比往常更加有斗志，\\n干劲十足呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a167fa6ba0ecab4a0dbabc6d3d4fa35d8e9b471734d081fbcef1924dd23a40c3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2e237b4a6c324a874848da7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "因为有不断积累努力和经验，\\n实力是有保证的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3621e65033d08e2eb9d6f0a5c83fd9726dadb74d577c687462e8488507053a2",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7cb097ef6d4539ec5ac7706c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "虽然是人气第二，\\n但是有着充满气魄的绝佳状态呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac8963ec246dc5d1d543c2a71ad1253d2214bc701878a113352bbc490f3a4d67",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbce19e5f9b009ab838ae964",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "凭借已开花的才能在沙土上疾驰，\\n证明自己压倒性的强大吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a298666e1cc5e94ae3cc51b2a759a3724bc99ddc6a55d3067e6f23eca6cc377",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:488aa12c3d66b5c0fd58db61",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "让我们在这个沙土的舞台上，\\n见证你能量全开的精彩跑法吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a89a716baa6239ce3840fa2e752796f6633f39a36806dfcd818eecbdb0c0b72f",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a750403a60f359be4756e7a",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "用超乎寻常的速度奔跑，\\n证明自己是短距离赛中的最速者吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf8347f68bc15995e887a70875a7da05eb0e6e64341ad1d904a5c00a31f8ffff",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2f61a7a2b19f74783ad8663",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "用平时无法想象的豪爽跑法，\\n制霸英里赛吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a7ccb1729c41ab8fbeb10a611acca26652b9809ee62930cea902a2fa2869083",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc56f9a54290358ee16f7d37",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "用大器晚成的堂堂正正的跑法，\\n登上中距离赛界的顶峰吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0097f05ab784058fdccb69040caa2450f00eee4716b8dbdc21255150577ad3",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc489422a5259731657ebe51",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "发挥出惊人的集中力和持久力，\\n将胜利掌握手中吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6867ea6d6344d779e0fe2987a42a5973a16d4fd4f97e5ced06b4d41fa4abf011",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8bdd02f3fbdea3c8cbe3fb51",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "用强大的精神力和钢铁般的意志，\\n来回应粉丝们的期待吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "653709fcb3474084219c1601f9f307cf6bf8c79f51d7c84c52b88871a56ddfad",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4c68cd41931f55718792139",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望把肩负的期待化作力量，\\n在经典级精锐云集的舞台上获胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "080c2d03735740816f5170b9ca4ab5ac395fce6bca4fcd33112a9eff8febc20b",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e2074f27b99efe9c8eadd0d6",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "拥有在全世界通用的实力，\\n希望在今年实现日本选手们的夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c16717ad661f3d71c305411c580ccc5c70079f71e326aa7c0cb7703baeee5cd",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45b27d4ef1d364c3a6b87667",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望把肩负的期待化作力量，\\n顺利攻克隆尚的一系列难关。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e91eef3d49017827505201a26b4bb9d6cc7422c08090622609a0a72a376fda",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:647ba1059ab907eaa119b378",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望心怀所有粉丝和从业者们的夙愿，\\n在凯旋门赏的历史上留下精彩跑法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "333d69c34be4cc1878262f3f87733eaa73789a9e68656b8d44943069f01cd73c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9aa1cf555eceec49d21ce87",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望这位年轻有为者用堂堂正正的跑法，\\n实现凯旋门赏制霸这项夙愿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1db1e645d32f27c11709b216987bf3b17dd05d191bee0cdb2c35c78b601d9958",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35e6f780eeb2796f1e29302f",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望能用与世界最高峰之光辉相配的跑法，\\n在凯旋门赏的历史上留下自己的蹄迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3854254eed5807371d17be914e9de34df61caf6e473fffda6a153594419d549",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4016"
      ]
    },
