      "uid": "zhcn:66a88d77a4ea39a9687798df",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "为凯旋门赏调整好了状态，\\n希望能让大家见证年轻挑战者的风范。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aff16bf14de7f38cd1686f49207e0b71cc5e117d0fc82cf92e819248b37dfc7f",
